join (values ('Cream Bath', 'Cream Bath (60 min)', 'Embark on a truly Balinese experience by indulging in the luxurious tradition of a Cream Bath ritual. Not to be missed on your Bali itinerary, this experience encompasses a blissful combination of rich heritage and modern hair care. Our carefully curated hair mask, free from harmful toxins, blends the hydrating properties of aloe vera, the nourishing essence of avocado extracts and the replenishin', 500000, 'IDR', 0), ('Scalp Treatment', 'Scalp Ritual (60 min)', 'Surrender to a holistic experience with our transformative botanical journey and embody the revitalizing spirit of our plant-powered, toxin-free Scalp Ritual. Let our skilled therapists melt away tension in your neck, head and shoulders by reactivating blood circulation. Infused with a soothing fusion of avocado and ginseng extracts, our potent elixir nurtures your scalp naturally for a renewed se', 500000, 'IDR', 0), ('Scalp Treatment', 'Scalp Ritual (Oil Free) (30 min)', 'Let our skilled therapists work their magic as they gently massage your scalp, relieving tension and promoting relaxation. This oil-free treatment is designed to enhance blood circulation and ease headaches, leaving you refreshed and rejuvenated.', 300000, 'IDR', 1), ('Other', 'Quick Glow (30 min)', 'Indulge in a rejuvenating Express Facial Massage, designed for those seeking a quick retreat from their daily hustle or for individuals looking to experience the soothing benefits of facial massage for the first time. Our expert therapists will gently stimulate circulation in your facial, neck and head regions, as delicate strokes and gentle pressure work to revitalize your skin and invigorate you', 300000, 'IDR', 0), ('Other', 'Sparkling Iceballs (60 min)', 'Indulge in our luxurious plant derived, toxic free Pressure Point Facial Massage, a revitalizing spa ritual specifically designed to rejuvenate your skin and relax your mind. This therapeutic facial massage targets key pressure points on the face, promoting increased circulation and stimulating relaxation to enhance your overall well-being. During the treatment, our skilled therapists will expertl', 600000, 'IDR', 1), ('Other', 'Natural Dreams (75 min)', 'Embark on a rejuvenating journey with our non-invasive traditional cleansing facial that harnesses the potent benefits of plant-derived ingredients, entirely free from toxins. This comprehensive facial experience incorporates the goodness of Sacha Inchi & Moringa oil, Jicama, Avocado & Calendula extracts and Cyprus & Bergamot essential oils. Enjoy a serene escape as your skin is treated to a purif', 800000, 'IDR', 2), ('Other', 'The Healing Act (60 min)', 'Experience a blend of traditional Balinese body massage techniques, including soothing rhythmic strokes that promote inner relaxation. Our specially formulated plant-based massage oil infused with calming notes of rose, black pepper & frankincense essential oils not only cater to specific benefits like relaxation, cleansing and tension release but also provide a host of nurturing elements for your', 400000, 'IDR', 3), ('Other', 'The Panel Beat (60 min)', 'Unleash the ultimate rejuvenating experience with The Panel Beat, a massage technique that sets the benchmark for deep tissue therapy. Calibrate your body''s rhythm as you surrender to the transcendent power of this massage, meticulously crafted to unlock persistent muscle tension and restore your body''s vitality. Ideal for surf enthusiasts looking to unwind after a day of exhilarating barrel rides', 500000, 'IDR', 4), ('Other', 'The Ultimate Euphoria (90 min)', 'Allow us to calm your senses with our gentle yet deeply relaxing bespoke signature body massage, meticulously crafted with plant-derived non-toxic ingredients sourced exclusively from within the Indonesian archipelago. Enhanced with nourishing Moringa and Sacha Inchi oils, this massage is infused with the aromatic essences of lemongrass, turmeric, nutmeg and eucalyptus essential oils, all derived ', 800000, 'IDR', 5), ('Other', 'Back in Harmony (30 min)', 'Experience the ultimate indulgence with our tailored therapeutic massage, meticulously crafted to target tension and tightness in your back, shoulders and neck. Whether you are desk-bound, a surfing enthusiast or a weary traveler seeking relief, this specialized treatment is expertly designed to dissolve stress and promote relaxation under the skilled hands of our therapists. Infused with our prem', 350000, 'IDR', 6), ('Other', 'The Mum to Be (60 min)', 'Experience the soothing comfort of our specially curated Pregnancy Massage, expertly delivered by our skilled and caring therapists. Featuring our luxurious plant-based oils, specifically crafted for their gentle and safe formula, this treatment is tailored to alleviate the discomforts of pregnancy and promote relaxation. Trust in our dedicated team to provide a nurturing and rejuvenating experien', 600000, 'IDR', 7), ('Other', 'Botanical Bliss (60 min)', 'Embark on a sensory journey with our Indonesian-inspired Sugar Scrub Ritual, featuring an exotic blend of locally sourced ingredients that capture the essence of Indonesia''s rich botanicals. This luxurious scrub showcases the star ingredients of our archipelago – Moringa oil, lemongrass, nutmeg, turmeric and eucalyptus essential oils – known for their aromatic and healing properties. Moringa oil d', 550000, 'IDR', 8), ('Other', 'Awaken Your Senses (60 min)', 'Soothe and restore sun-exposed skin with our Luxe Botanical Body Mask, a deeply replenishing spa experience crafted from locally sourced, plant-derived, toxin-free ingredients. Kaolin gently purifies and refreshes skin that has been exposed to heat and environmental stress, while Moringa and coconut cream deliver rich hydration and nourishment. Avocado and Centella extracts help support collagen r', 550000, 'IDR', 9), ('Other', 'Relaxology (30 min)', 'Indulge in our Calming Foot Massage, a blissful experience tailored for relaxation enthusiasts. Our skilled therapists will envelop you with gentle, soothing strokes, designed to alleviate tension in your feet and lower legs. Enhancing this experience is our specially crafted hydrating foot butter, a luxurious blend of shea butter, rosemary and lemon essential oils, designed to deeply moisturize a', 300000, 'IDR', 10), ('Other', 'Two Slices of Heaven (105 min)', 'Enhance your spa experience with our deluxe package, which includes The Healing Act 60 min massage along with your choice of a body scrub or mask. Your experience kicks off with a calming 5 min Foot Ritual, preparing you for a restorative 1h 40 min treatment that will elevate your self-care routine.', 800000, 'IDR', 11), ('Other', 'Three Slices of Heaven (180 min)', 'Embark on a profound self-care journey with our ultimate spa experience. Begin with The Healing Act 60 min massage using natural oils that soothe your senses and promote deep relaxation. Next, indulge in our luxurious Sparkling Iceballs Facial, where the refreshing ice-cold spheres, combined with our plant-based skincare products free of any harmful toxins revitalize your skin. Finally, choose fro', 1300000, 'IDR', 12), ('Spa Package', 'A Salty Ritual (60 min)', 'Indulge in a truly Balinese spa experience with our Sea Salt Scrub ritual. Enriched with local calendula flowers and hand-harvested Balinese sea salt from the village of Kusumba, renowned for its salt-making tradition, this ritual offers holistic renewal of your skin. The soothing properties of Balinese calendula combined with the mineral-infused Kusumba Sea Salt will elevate your skin''s luminosit', 550000, 'IDR', 0), ('Reflexology', 'Reflexology (30 min)', 'Immerse yourself in our blissful Foot Reflexology, an ancient art that offers holistic relaxation and rejuvenation. Let our skilled therapists apply targeted pressure to specific points on your feet, aligning with various organs and systems of the body. Our massage features a specially crafted, plant-based, non-toxic hydrating foot butter, designed to nourish dry, cracked or rough skin. This luxur', 300000, 'IDR', 0), ('Manicure', 'Therapeutic Manicure (75 min)', 'Revitalize your nails and hands with our Therapeutic Manicure, a wellness-focused experience that embraces the power of nature. We prioritize your well-being by using only plant-based, non-toxic products throughout the treatment. Our skilled technicians expertly shape and buff your nails, ensuring a flawless result followed by gentle exfoliation that leaves your hands feeling velvety smooth. Relax', 500000, 'IDR', 0), ('Pedicure', 'Therapeutic Pedicure (75 min)', 'Immerse yourself in ultimate self-care with our Therapeutic Pedicure, where your foot health and wellbeing are our top priorities. We prioritize your wellbeing by using only plant-based, non-toxic products throughout the treatment. Our skilled technicians will expertly shape and buff your nails, ensuring a flawless result followed by exfoliation that leaves your feet feeling soft and renewed. Your', 500000, 'IDR', 0)) as i(sec, name, descr, price, cur, pos) on i.sec = secs.name;

