join (values ('Four Hands Massage', 'Four Hands Massage (60 min)', 'It feels like getting two massages at once. It’s a sensory experience that allows you to abandon control and simply enjoy and embrace this sensational massage style.', 345000, 'IDR', 0), ('Four Hands Massage', 'Four Hands Massage (90 min)', 'It feels like getting two massages at once. It’s a sensory experience that allows you to abandon control and simply enjoy and embrace this sensational massage style.', 485000, 'IDR', 1), ('Traditional Massage', 'Campur-Campur Massage (90 min)', 'This treatment begins with Balinese body palming, followed by a full-body massage and traditional pandan compresses, which have a calming effect on the body and mind.', 265000, 'IDR', 0), ('Traditional Massage', 'Tension Relief Massage (60 min)', 'This massage focuses on the back, glutes and hamstring to enhance blood circulation and allow tissues to receive more oxygen and nutrients. This helps relieve accumulated muscle stress.', 195000, 'IDR', 1), ('Traditional Massage', 'Tension Relief Massage (90 min)', 'This massage focuses on the back, glutes and hamstring to enhance blood circulation and allow tissues to receive more oxygen and nutrients. This helps relieve accumulated muscle stress.', 265000, 'IDR', 2), ('Traditional Massage', 'Body Worship Signature Massage (60 min)', 'This massage technique combines deep tissue and Shiatsu methods. It uses firm pressure with slow movements and significant finger pressure points. Additionally, it incorporates elements of acupressure. The goal is to relieve tension and tightness in the bodies muscles and connective tissues.', 235000, 'IDR', 3), ('Traditional Massage', 'Body Worship Signature Massage (90 min)', 'This massage technique combines deep tissue and Shiatsu methods. It uses firm pressure with slow movements and significant finger pressure points. Additionally, it incorporates elements of acupressure. The goal is to relieve tension and tightness in the bodies muscles and