logist use his thumb pressure to press and deeply massage each of the tiny reflex zones in your feed to stimulate the associated organs and glands thereby activating the body’s natural healing mechanisms and correcting imbalances.', 125000, 'IDR', 2), ('Body Scrub', 'Body Scrub', 'Treat yourself to an exfoliating scrub removing dead skin cells leaving your skin feeling soft and smooth. Select our range of essences including the famous Bali Coffee Scrub.', 210000, 'IDR', 0), ('Body Scrub', 'Body Scrub', 'Treat yourself to an exfoliating scrub removing dead skin cells leaving your skin feeling soft and smooth.', 210000, 'IDR', 1), ('Javanese Lulur', 'Traditional “Lulur”', 'Our traditional lulur is a truly pampering ritual; it comprises an aromatic massage, exfoliating body scrub and relaxing floral bath.', 490000, 'IDR', 0), ('Javanese Lulur', 'Traditional “Lulur” (180 min)', 'Our traditional lulur is a truly pampering ritual; the lulur is a treat for everyone.', 490000, 'IDR', 1)) as i(sec, name, descr, price, cur, pos) on i.sec = secs.name;

