join (values ('Other', 'Tirta Gangga (90 min)', 'This is a perfect treatment for calming the burning sensation after sunbathing. Our Tirta Gangga Treatment will calm, soothe and heal your skin and help you to get a healthy tan and youthful glow. We begin with a foot bath using warm water mixed with lemon grass and sea salt. The body is then wrapped in a mixture of Cananga (Balinese flower) & Aloe Vera, after is a relaxing Balinese herbal bath wi', 665500, 'IDR', 0), ('Other', 'Tenganan Face Cleansing (60 min)', 'This signature facial treatment provides deep skin cleansing. A purifying scrub and a soothing mask revitalize your skin. In addition to the face, this treatment is excellent for hands, shoulders and feet.', 363000, 'IDR', 1), ('Other', 'Royal Karangasem (120 min)', 'Our signature treatment is based on the centuries-old process used at the Royal Balinese Palace. A warm water foot bath with lemon grass and sea salt begins your journey to a pampered state of relaxation.', 713350, 'IDR', 2), ('Other', 'Candidasa Gateway (180 min)', 'Exclusively designed for couples, this treatment enhances the harmony of body and mind. We begin with lemon grass & sea salts added to warm water for your foot bath.', 1175502, 'IDR', 3), ('Other', 'Tirta Gangga (90 min)', 'A perfect treatment for calming the burning sensation after sunbathing. Calms, soothes and heals skin and helps achieve a healthy tan and youthful glow.', 665500, 'IDR', 4), ('Other', 'Tenganan Face Cleansing (60 min)', 'Signature facial treatment providing deep skin cleansing with a purifying scrub and a soothing mask that revitalizes the skin.', 363000, 'IDR', 5), ('Other', 'Royal Karangasem (120 min)', 'Signature treatment drawing on decades-old processes used at the Royal Balinese Palace, including a warm foot bath and body massage with natural scrubs.', 713350, 'IDR', 6), ('Other', 'Candidasa Gateway (180 min)', 'Designed for couples, begins with a foot bath and continues with body massage, scrub, body wrap, and a face cleansing treatment.', 1175502, 'IDR', 7), ('Hair Treatment', 'Hair Spa Treatment (60 min)', 'An extra ordinary treatment and deep conditioning for damaged and dry hair, using ''L’oreal Hair Spa Nourishing Cream Bath'' with supplement for the scalp. The cream will be liberally applied before massaging the hair, section by section. The treatment includes a stress-relieving head and neck massage to stimulate the scalp, soothe sore shoulders, soften locks, follicles and give extra shine.', 580000, 'IDR', 0), ('Hair Treatment', 'Hair Spa Treatment (60 min)', 'Extra ordinary treatment and deep conditioning for damaged and dry hair, using “L’oreal Hair Spa Nourishing Cream Bath” with supplement for the scalp. Includes a stress-relieving head and neck massage.', 580000, 'IDR', 1), ('Scalp Treatment', 'Scalp Hair Treatment (60 min)', 'Our traditional hair treatment using Aloe Vera – Avocado conditioning cream is massaged into your scalp. The ozone steam process then conditions and rejuvenates your hair.', 363000, 'IDR', 0), ('Scalp Treatment', 'Scalp Hair Treatment (60 min)', 'Our traditional hair treatment using Aloe Vera – Avocado conditioning cream is massaged into your scalp. The ozone steam process then conditions and rejuvenates your hair.', 363000, 'IDR', 1), ('Pedicure', 'Pedicure (60 min)', 'Foot nail and cuticle treatment followed by foot massage using ''Gehwol'' foot care plus nail polish or nail art.', 338800, 'IDR', 0), ('Pedicure', 'Pedicure (60 min)', 'Foot nail and cuticle treatment followed by foot massage using “Gehwol” foot care plus nail polish or nail art.', 338800, 'IDR', 1), ('Manicure', 'Manicure (60 min)', 'Hand nail and cuticle treatment followed with hand massage plus nail polish or nail art.', 338800, 'IDR', 0), ('Manicure', 'Manicure (60 min)', 'Hand nail and cuticle treatment followed with hand massage plus nail polish or nail art.', 338800, 'IDR', 1), ('Traditional Massage', 'Puri Sense Body Massage (60 min)', 'A Royal village secret recipe with blends of essential oil extracts from Balinese spices and flowers, especially prepared to relax and soothe your senses. The treatment includes gentle and relaxing strokes along with vigorous pressure-point stimulations to reduce stress, relieve strained muscles, stimulate blood circulation, detoxify the body as well as nourish the skin.', 847000, 'IDR', 0), ('Traditional Massage', 'Traditional Candidasa Body Massage (60 min)', 'A full-body and powerful massage from Candidasa to release tension, realigns your sense, and calms you down. It combines aroma of the essential oils with application of some techniques including skin rolling, kneading and stroking and pressure point stimulation.', 847000, 'IDR', 1), ('Traditional Massage', 'Puri Sense Body Massage (60 min)', 'A royal village secret recipe with blends of essential oil extracts from Balinese spices and flowers, designed to relax and soothe your senses.', 847000, 'IDR', 2), ('Traditional Massage', 'Traditional Candidasa Body Massage (60 min)', 'A full-body powerful massage from Candidasa to release tension, realign senses and calm you down.', 847000, 'IDR', 3), ('Reflexology', 'Foot Reflexology (45 min)', 'We provide a combination of ancient Indonesian and Chinese acupressure techniques to relax your feet and improve blood circulation. Our traditional oil will warm and strengthen your foot muscles.', 302500, 'IDR', 0), ('Reflexology', 'Foot Reflexology (45 min)', 'Combination of ancient Indonesian and Chinese acupressure techniques to relax your feet and improve blood circulation.', 302500, 'IDR', 1), ('Foot Massage', 'Geringsing Foot & Shoulder Massage (45 min)', 'Pamper yourself with a rejuvenating treatment for relaxation, release of tension along with improvement on mental and emotional state. It involves applying pressure to the feet and shoulder to affect a physical change in the body.', 272250, 'IDR', 0), ('Foot Massage', 'Geringsing Foot & Shoulder Massage (45 min)', 'Rejuvenating treatment for relaxation and release of tension applying pressure to feet and shoulder to spur physical changes in the body.', 272250, 'IDR', 1)) as i(sec, name, descr, price, cur, pos) on i.sec = secs.name;

